  "releaseNotes": "'## [13.3.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.2.1...v13.3.0) (2026-09-22)\n\n### Features\n\n* **cli/rbac:** add explicit --rbac-scope option ([#1251](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1251)) ([29448c0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/29448c0fc34707e33cd3c6c8e61b7e447ff8d827)), closes [#1213](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1213)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **transpiler:** terminate type-graph walks that never end ([#1252](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1252)) ([011ae0c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/011ae0c026b8232a0460870987ed27d401b7c274)), closes [#1233](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1233) [#1233](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1233) [1141/#1201](https://github.com/1141/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1201)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update dependency dotnet-sdk to v10 ([#1250](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1250)) ([7041dc5](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/7041dc5608185c9a6f08d1562a8d1e1b405d7f9a))\n* **core:** update aspire monorepo ([#1248](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1248)) ([bc23184](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/bc23184beb56015771a9d141d024e9f552220145))\n* **core:** update dependency messagepack to 3.1.9 ([#1253](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1253)) ([aa1dbb2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/aa1dbb2addb67af52de21fd95681a843949ca0b8))\n* **core:** update opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib monorepo to 1.19.0 ([#1254](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1254)) ([8123dea](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8123dea9a1fd7ec0819392590f3c2c8af13f71ee))\n* **test:** update dependency microsoft.net.test.sdk to 18.10.1 ([#1249](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1249)) ([281d938](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/281d9388fe434809573f8a0fa2ef73793a13c563))\n* **test:** update opentelemetry-dotnet monorepo ([#1255](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1255)) ([ab9f6fb](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/ab9f6fb6cc0d3f3010dabe3c7aaab071219f3094))\n* **test:** update opentelemetry-dotnet monorepo ([#1258](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1258)) ([22c67f9](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/22c67f91d54ed9f8c9825acd935f266ef6ea899b))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.18 ([#1259](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1259)) ([bc9da7a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/bc9da7ac86f27f46d9bdcbc3f3b691058712ac67))\n'",
